# The ledger branch (docs/guide/how-ledger.md).
title: Every record lands on the ledger as one fast-forward commit, retried until it wins the race
direction: down
verb: A verb wants to record something
lock: Take the clone's ledger lock
tip: Fetch the ledger tip into a private ref
apply: Apply files in a temporary worktree
push: Push the commit as a fast-forward
ledger: ledger branch: specs, proof, actions, audit
verb -> lock
lock -> tip
tip -> apply
apply -> push
push -> tip: rejected: retry
push -> ledger: accepted
